-### Test Deferred Props
-
-```ruby
-it 'defers expensive analytics data' do
-  get dashboard_path
-
-  expect(inertia).to have_deferred_props(:analytics, :statistics)
-  expect(inertia).to have_deferred_props(:slow_data, group: :slow)
-end
-```
